    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:fb5db666cae6efb7",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "115d26b45244360d82c89be165ebd03d0f401e5e003f1a4185d6c96b3460adff",
      "text": "Breakfast in the hotel. Transfer to the airport for your flight to Manaus.\n\nArrival at Manaus airport. Transfer to the city of Manaus, You will be taken to Eco Lodge Evolution on a speedboat. Eco Lodge Evolution is a jungle hotel for eco-tourism lovers who prefer to relax in close contact with the natural beauty of the Amazon jungle.\n\nCheck in at the lodge, followed by dinner and an evening programme. At night, you can join a safari to look for caimans.\n\nFor the included transfer, you must arrive in Manaus before 16:00. Later arrivals require a private transfer at an additional cost.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-08163b3a444d",
        "model": "GPT-6",
        "wordAbsenceReason": "Word p70–71 supplies the flight and lodge transfer paragraphs, retained verbatim. Dinner, evening activities, caiman safari and the before-16:00 shared-transfer condition are absent from the Word and translated from the assigned RU gap.",
